{"id":"centime","lemma":"centime","pos":"noun","rank":4659,"glosses":["centime (hundredth of a franc, coin)","cent (one-hundredth of a euro), eurocent"],"ipa":"/sɑ̃.tim/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c6/Fr-centime.ogg/Fr-centime.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"centimes"},"formAudio":{"centimes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-centimes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je n'ai pas un centime.","en":"I don't have a cent.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je ne vous donnerai pas un centime.","en":"I won't give you one red cent.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tu m'as donné seulement cinquante centimes.","en":"You gave me only fifty cents.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"fifty"},null]},{"text":"Nous n'avons même pas un centime.","en":"We haven't got a penny.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"no, not even!"]]},{"text":"Cette poupée ne coûte que soixante centimes.","en":"This doll costs only sixty cents.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"doll"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to cost","l":"coûter"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"sixty"},null]}]}